### Describe the bug

When I run `gh pr merge --auto --squash "$PR_URL" -A "sass.bot.beep.boop@gmail.com"` through GitHub actions, I see the error `GraphQL: Invalid email address (mergePullRequest)`. See [this action](https://github.com/sass/dart-sass/actions/runs/38829304699/job/116746699927?pr=2879) as an example.

I've also reproduced this locally.

### Affected version

I've verified this with gh version 2.102.0 (2026-09-30).

### Steps to reproduce the behavior

1. Run `gh pr merge -A "sass.bot.beep.boop@gmail.com"`
2. See the error message

### Expected vs actual behavior

I would expect the (fully valid, used by the GitHub account) email address to be allowed.

